Yes. You can take the following steps to ensure your data security when using online services or applications: 
1. Only use reputable, trusted services or applications; 
2. Check the service provider's privacy policy to make sure it meets your expectations;
3. Ensure all personal information is properly encrypted (ideally, end-to-end encryption); 
4. Use a secure internet connection with the latest software protection updates installed; 
5. Use multi-factor authentication whenever available; and 6. Monitor your personal data and bank statements for any irregular activity.
